# Base64 text encoding. The clean uniform interface; the per-env native implementation is selected at build time and hidden behind the API.

load @cluesurf/base/code/native/text/base64
  find to-base64
  find from-base64

task encode
  take input, like text
  like text
  send back
    call to-base64
      read input

task decode
  take input, like text
  like text
  send back
    call from-base64
      read input
